    {
      "id": "blk_8445a464",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "「黑潮」是黎那汐塔地区特有的海蚀现象，黑潮会在天空中形成聚拢的黑色云海，在聚集至顶峰时便会如瀑布般倾泻而下。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 2,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 3,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_7a8acb51",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "这些黑色云雾会向周边区域迅速扩散，黑潮所至之处，将会生成残象，而黑潮爆发的原点将生成新的无音区。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 3,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 4,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_8a830751",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在拉古那，较大规模的黑潮曾经发生过两次。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
      "style": {
        "italic": false,
        "speech_mode": ""
      },
      "meta": {
        "source_order": 4,
        "source_type": "文本正文",
        "source_row": 5,
        "xlsx_section_index": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "blk_5363d8a3",
      "type": "text_body",
      "text": "在隐海修会的记载中，第一次黑潮被修会的初代主座那不盖勒二世所阻止，第二次黑潮则由于圣女芙露德莉斯的自愿牺牲而最终消弭。",
      "annotations": {
        "manual_refs": [],
        "omissions": [],
        "settings": []
      },
